OL,3,AIsraeli exit polls suggest no clear
OL,4,Awinner with Eisenkot's bloc just ahead
OL,5,Aof Netanyahu
OL,6,
OL,7,FIsraeli exit polls suggest Gadi
OL,8,FEisenkot's bloc - which opposes
OL,9,Fincumbent Benjamin Netanyahu - has won
OL,10,Fthe largest number of seats in the
OL,11,Fcountry's general election
OL,13,FThe exit polls also suggest Netanyahu's
OL,14,FLikud party is set to be the biggest
OL,15,Fsingle party in the Israeli Parliament
OL,17,FIsraeli elections can be decided by
OL,18,Ffine margins and exit polls have been
OL,19,Fwrong in the past
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
