OL,3,AIsraeli exit polls suggest no clear
OL,4,Awinner with Eisenkot's bloc just ahead
OL,5,Aof Netanyahu
OL,6,
OL,7,FPreliminary results are due on
OL,8,FWednesday, and official results are
OL,9,Fscheduled to be published at the start
OL,10,Fof November
OL,12,FAll 120 seats in the Knesset, Israel's
OL,13,Fparliament, are up for grabs, but no
OL,14,Fparty has ever won a majority and
OL,15,Fgovernments have in the past been made
OL,16,Fup of coalitions
OL,18,FIt is Israel's first legislative
OL,19,Felection since the Hamas-led attacks on
OL,20,F7 October 2023 - our reporter looks at
OL,21,Fthe big issues on the campaign trail
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
